{"uid":"ccba63e0b2f8b57a","name":"TestNodeClusterSuite/TestThreeNodesCluster","fullName":"github.com/lf-edge/eve/evetest/tests/cluster.TestNodeClusterSuite/TestThreeNodesCluster","time":{"start":1795646318000,"stop":1795646972220,"duration":654220},"status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"testStage":{"steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},"afterStages":[],"labels":[{"name":"resultFormat","value":"junit"},{"name":"suite","value":"github.com/lf-edge/eve/evetest/tests/cluster"},{"name":"testClass","value":"github.com/lf-edge/eve/evetest/tests/cluster"},{"name":"package","value":"github.com/lf-edge/eve/evetest/tests/cluster"}],"parameters":[],"links":[],"hidden":false,"retry":false,"extra":{"severity":"normal","retries":[],"categories":[],"history":{"statistic":{"failed":2,"broken":0,"skipped":0,"passed":25,"unknown":0,"total":27},"items":[{"uid":"b57f4a717a4fd738","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/51/#testresult/b57f4a717a4fd738","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795558062000,"stop":1795558775870,"duration":713870}},{"uid":"39a0158238142e49","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/46/#testresult/39a0158238142e49","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795497510000,"stop":1795498202580,"duration":692580}},{"uid":"85994633dfdd0aa0","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/41/#testresult/85994633dfdd0aa0","status":"failed","statusDetails":"Device \"edge-dev2\": expected 0 reboot(s) but observed 1\n\nClaude's conclusion:\n### Root cause\n\nLive `NodeAgentStatus` on `edge-dev2` shows `RebootReason: BootReasonKubeTransition, Reboot after retry cluster transition attempt 1` (`RestartCounter:1`, reboot at `2026-11-22T23:29:41Z`). `gotest.json` confirms the mechanism directly: cluster-join stalled for 11 minutes (`initial-config-applied` at 23:18:43, then \"Still waiting for cluster nodes to become ready...\" every minute through 23:29:43) before EVE-K's own retry logic self-rebooted `edge-dev2`; this time the retry actually worked — the cluster reported ready just ~1 minute later (23:30:57) — but the harness's \"expected 0 reboot(s)\" check still failed the test on the extra reboot.\n\nThis is the same underlying nodeagent/kube-transition \"stuck join → retry-reboot\" mechanism documented repeatedly in `live-ledger.md` since at least 2026-10-29 (8 occurrences), always previously seen on `edge-dev3` in `TestClusterVMApp`, where the retry reboot left the node permanently rejected with `\"not authorized\"`. Here it's a new manifestation of that same known bug: a different test (`TestThreeNodesCluster`) and device (`edge-dev2`), and critically the retry *succeeded* this time rather than permanently breaking the join — it just still tripped the reboot-count assertion. It does not share a root cause with this run's earlier-investigated `TestAppInstancePurge` failure (that was a config-not-carried-forward device-reuse issue, not a stuck join). `evetest broker status` shows the Proxmox host at 99% of RAM committed to running VMs (23/23), a plausible contributing factor to the slow convergence that triggered the retry-reboot path, though I can't confirm causation beyond that correlation.","time":{"start":1795387643000,"stop":1795388885640,"duration":1242640}},{"uid":"ad4fb08f01d0b56c","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/36/#testresult/ad4fb08f01d0b56c","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795308462000,"stop":1795309116980,"duration":654980}},{"uid":"7081c6c97014a2c1","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/31/#testresult/7081c6c97014a2c1","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795214015000,"stop":1795214691450,"duration":676450}},{"uid":"3e21e6bffccb261a","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/27/#testresult/3